{
  "_comment": [
    "Which vendor PNGs go into which atlas, under which frame name.",
    "",
    "Frame names are OURS, not Kenney's (docs/51 \u00a74). That indirection is the",
    "whole point: swapping art packs is an edit to this file, and skins.json",
    "never learns where a pixel came from.",
    "",
    "Paths are relative to assets/vendor/kenney/. A missing source is reported",
    "and skipped \u2014 the atlas still builds, and the frame falls back to a",
    "procedural placeholder at runtime (docs/50 \u00a78)."
  ],
